From eee918b41bd68d5679e3793437e3f4f7ca82c691 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: spartanz51 <a.m@tuta.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:03:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [sdk] Download blobs referenced by an instance

Adds BlobFacade::download_blobs: requests a read token scoped to the
referencing instance (as TS requestReadTokenBlobs does, so the archive
need not be owned), downloads the blobs 100 per request, and returns the
encrypted payloads by blob id. A 403 evicts the token and restarts the
read once (doBlobRequestWithRetry); errors specific to one blob server
fail over to the next (tryServers). Read tokens are cached apart from
write tokens.
